DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbccmmssddhhoosstt driver provides support for the SD controllers integrated
     on Broadcom BCM283x and BCM2711 SoCs.  The driver uses the bcmdmac(4) DMA
     controller to provide DMA support.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     whatever SD devices are inserted into the card slot or directly connected
     to the controller.

